  "question": {
    "text": "If the radius of curvature of the path of two particles of same mass are in the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mn>4</mn></math>, then in order to have constant centripetal force, their velocities will be in the ratio of:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "IowEG",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "5GXIH",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Blshj",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MV4sr",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>As centripetal force is given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math>, in order to have the same centripetal force, we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
